countries where the spread of polio is endemic.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 2080, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-307578a431f872cb201d", "filename": "Multiple Polio Virus Testing.pdf", "sha256": "307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 4}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "According to the article, most new polio cases occurred in\na) Pakistan and India.\nb) Afghanistan.\nc) Nigeria.\nd) countries previously thought to be polio-free.", "sourcePage": 2, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 2416, "answer": {"text": "D", "source": {"id": "offline-307578a431f872cb201d", "filename": "Multiple Polio Virus Testing.pdf", "sha256": "307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 4}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Which factor caused a significant delay in virus identification?\na) field conditions\nb) laboratory performance\nc) shipping time\nd) high immunization coverage", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 291, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-307578a431f872cb201d", "filename": "Multiple Polio Virus Testing.pdf", "sha256": "307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 4}}, {"number": 7, "prompt": "In which region was the new algorithm tested in 2006?\na) The Americas\nb) The Mediterranean\nc) South East Asia\nd) Africa", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 453, "answer": {"text": "A", "source": {"id": "offline-307578a431f872cb201d", "filename": "Multiple Polio Virus Testing.pdf", "sha256": "307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 4}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "In 2005, how long did it take to identify the virus in the African region?\na) 21 days\nb) 45 days\nc) 42 days\nd) 18 days", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 577, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-307578a431f872cb201d", "filename": "Multiple Polio Virus Testing.pdf", "sha256": "307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca24fa34e6b464.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 4}}], "skills": ["listening", "reading", "writing", "speaking"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-307578a431f872cb201d", "filename": "Multiple Polio Virus Testing.pdf", "sha256": "307578a431f872cb201d97de9de8c1ae1a4211614fd56edb2eca2